AWEN 0.1

PROJECT ZeroReel
OUTPUT feature refinement
ROOT .

REPOSITORY
  MODE existing
  ROOT .
  REMOTE https://github.com/<owner>/zeroreel
  BRANCH main
  BASE <commit-or-tag-if-pinning-is-needed>

SOURCES
  PRODUCT       ./docs/product.md       AUTHORITATIVE
  UX            ./docs/ux.md            AUTHORITATIVE
  ARCHITECTURE  ./docs/architecture.md  AUTHORITATIVE
  ENGINEERING   ./docs/engineering.md   AUTHORITATIVE

BEHAVIOR
  primary film playback happens on the ZeroReel film detail page through approved YouTube or Vimeo embeds when embedding is allowed
  users stay on ZeroReel for the primary watch experience
  external source links remain visible for provenance, fallback and platform attribution

REQUIRE
  preserve the existing responsive web MVP
  preserve submission, curation, discovery and profile flows unless explicitly changed
  embedded playback remains the primary watch path

PREFER
  smallest change that satisfies this refinement
  CSS OVER JavaScript for presentation
  progressive enhancement

AVOID
  unrelated refactors
  new dependencies unless necessary
  reopening settled product decisions

FORBID
  outbound-only primary film playback
  rebuilding the application from scratch

APPROVAL
  HUMAN destructive database migrations
  HUMAN authentication architecture changes
  HUMAN new external services

DONE WHEN
  approved YouTube and Vimeo sources embed correctly on film detail pages
  source provenance and fallback links remain visible
  existing product flows still work
  relevant tests pass
  no unrelated existing behaviour is changed
